<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>肾虚感寒 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E8%82%BE%E8%99%9A%E6%84%9F%E5%AF%92/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.1 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 11:19:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E8%82%BE%E8%99%9A%E6%84%9F%E5%AF%92/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>阴治法：论肾虚感寒 水亏夜热</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/2-11-yinzhifa/</link><pubDate>Thu, 30 Apr 2026 11:11:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/2-11-yinzhifa/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E4%BA%8C%E4%B9%90%E9%9B%86/">卷二乐集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“阴治法”部分，专论&lt;strong&gt;肾水亏虚而兼阴邪外犯&lt;/strong&gt;的证治。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;阴气不足为本，阴邪乘虚而入为标&lt;/strong&gt;。治当&lt;strong&gt;峻补真阴，或于水中补火&lt;/strong&gt;，使阴水足则虚火自消，阳得阴制则寒邪自散。切不可误作阳证而用辛散苦寒，以免铄尽真阴。</description></item></channel></rss>